<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title> Your Magical Story - SweetDreams AI </title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:ital,wght@0,200..1000;1,200..1000&family=Poppins:ital,wght@0,100;0,200;0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;0,900;1,100;1,200;1,300;1,400;1,500;1,600;1,700;1,800;1,900&family=Quicksand:wght@300..700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: "Nunito", "Quicksand", "Poppins", sans-serif;
        }

        :root {
            --primary: #4356ff;
            --dark: #2c2c2c;
            --light: #ffffff;
            --paper: #fefefe;
            --text: #2c2c2c;
            --accent: #8a2be2;
        }

        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.8;
            min-height: 100vh;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        body.darkmode {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2c2c2c 0%, #1a1a1a 100%);
            --paper: #1a1a1a;
            --text: #e0e0e0;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        /* Story Card */
        .story-card {
            background: var(--paper);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 60px 50px;
            box-shadow: 
                0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1),
                0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        body.darkmode .story-card {
            box-shadow: 
                0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3),
                0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }

        .story-card::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 4px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary), var(--accent));
        }

        /* Story Content */
        .story-title {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.3;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        body.darkmode .story-title {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a78bfa, #6366f1);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        .story-content {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 350;
            color: var(--text);
            text-align: justify;
            hyphens: auto;
        }

        .story-content p {
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            text-indent: 2rem;
            font-weight: 350;
        }

        .story-content p:first-child::first-letter {
            font-size: 4rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            float: left;
            line-height: 1;
            margin-right: 0.5rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        body.darkmode .story-content p:first-child::first-letter {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a78bfa, #6366f1);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
        }

        /* Action Buttons */
        .action-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-top: 50px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 15px 30px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            min-width: 160px;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent));
            color: white;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(67, 84, 255, 0.4);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--text);
            border: 2px solid var(--text);
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background: var(--text);
            color: var(--paper);
        }

        /* Theme Toggle */
        .theme-toggle {
            position: fixed;
            top: 20px;
            right: 20px;
            background: var(--primary);
            border: none;
            border-radius: 50%;
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            cursor: pointer;
            z-index: 1000;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }

        .theme-toggle:hover {
            transform: scale(1.1);
        }

        .theme-toggle img {
            width: 24px;
            height: 24px;
            filter: invert(1);
        }

        /* Decorative Elements */
        .story-card::after {
            content: "✨";
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 20px;
            right: 20px;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            opacity: 0.3;
        }

        /* Reading Optimizations */
        .story-content {
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
            word-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .story-content p {
            orphans: 3;
            widows: 3;
        }

        /* Mobile Responsiveness */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .container {
                padding: 20px 15px;
            }
            
            .story-card {
                padding: 40px 25px;
                border-radius: 15px;
            }
            
            .story-title {
                font-size: 2rem;
                margin-bottom: 30px;
            }
            
            .story-content {
                font-size: 1.1rem;
                text-align: left;
            }
            
            .story-content p:first-child::first-letter {
                font-size: 3rem;
            }
            
            .action-buttons {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
            }
            
            .btn {
                width: 100%;
                max-width: 300px;
                text-align: center;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .story-card {
                padding: 30px 20px;
            }
            
            .story-title {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }
            
            .story-content {
                font-size: 1rem;
            }
        }

        /* Smooth fade-in animation */
        @keyframes fadeInUp {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(30px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .story-card {
            animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Theme Toggle -->
    <button class="theme-toggle" id="themeToggle">
        <img src="./icons/moon.svg" alt="Toggle theme" id="themeIcon">
    </button>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="story-card">
            <h1 class="story-title" id="storyTitle">The Adventure of the Whispering Woods</h1>
            
            <div class="story-content" id="storyContent">
                <p>In a land where the moonbeams danced with the fireflies, there lived a curious little fox named Pip. His fur was the color of autumn leaves, and his eyes sparkled with the wonder of a thousand stories waiting to be discovered. Every evening, as the sun dipped below the horizon, Pip would sit by the ancient oak tree, listening to the whispers of the wind.</p>

                <p>One starlit night, the wind carried a new sound—a soft, melodic hum that seemed to call Pip's name. Without a second thought, he followed the enchanting melody deep into the heart of the Whispering Woods. The trees seemed to lean in, sharing secrets only the bravest could hear.</p>

                <p>As Pip ventured further, he discovered a clearing where the stars themselves appeared to be resting on the ground. Tiny, glowing mushrooms formed a path leading to a crystal-clear pond. In the center of the pond floated a lily pad, and on it sat a frog with a crown made of morning dew.</p>

                <p>"Welcome, little fox," croaked the frog in a voice like raindrops on petals. "I've been waiting for you. The fireflies need your help to light their way to the Dream Meadow."</p>

                <p>Pip's heart swelled with excitement. He puffed out his chest and declared, "I'll help them! Tell me what I must do."</p>

                <p>The frog explained that the fireflies had lost their glow because children had stopped believing in magic. Pip needed to collect three things: a feather from the Sleepy Owl, a dewdrop from the Silver Spider's web, and a note from the Cricket's evening song.</p>

                <p>With courage in his heart and the frog's directions, Pip set off on his magical quest, determined to bring the light back to the fireflies and restore magic to the Whispering Woods.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="action-buttons">
                <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">✨ Create Another Story</a>
                <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="window.print()">📄 Print This Story</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        // Theme toggle functionality
        const themeToggle = document.getElementById('themeToggle');
        const themeIcon = document.getElementById('themeIcon');

        themeToggle.addEventListener('click', () => {
            document.body.classList.toggle('darkmode');
            if (document.body.classList.contains('darkmode')) {
                themeIcon.src = "./icons/sun.svg";
            } else {
                themeIcon.src = "./icons/moon.svg";
            }
        });

        // Add subtle parallax effect to background
        window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
            const scrolled = window.pageYOffset;
            const rate = scrolled * -0.5;
            document.body.style.backgroundPosition = `0px ${rate}px`;
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
